            "name": "get Payments Program Onboarding",
            "description": {
              "content": "<span class=\"tablenote\"><b>Note:</b> This method is no longer applicable, as all seller accounts globally have been enabled for the new eBay payment and checkout flow.</span><br>This method retrieves a seller's onboarding status for a payments program for a specified marketplace. The overall onboarding status of the seller and the status of each onboarding step is returned.",
